<https://w3id.org/laderr#disables> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates that an enabled Capability changes the state of a Disposition (either a Capability or Vulnerability) to disabled, preventing it from being realized. This implies the disabler must be enabled and the target must have been previously enabled."@en .
_:n2547adcb7a364616ab6df8f6aa40ce15b35 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
