<https://w3id.org/laderr#threatens> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/laderr#Threat> .
_:n2547adcb7a364616ab6df8f6aa40ce15b7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<https://ugent-businessinformatics.github.io/> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/homepage> "https://ugent-businessinformatics.github.io/"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preservesAgainst> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates that a Resilience maintains a Capability’s function despite the presence of a Threat's Capability that could exploit a Vulnerability."@en .
