<http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#Control> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A fire suppression system in a data center acts as a Control that inhibits fire-related threats and protects the servers."@en .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#Construct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An abstract class encompassing both Scenarios and ScenarioComponents. I.e., any instantiable construct expressible in a LaDeRR specification."@en .
