<https://w3id.org/laderr#positiveDamage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Superclass for relationships that indicate a positive occurrence of damage. Encompasses relations where a Threat either can cause or has caused damage to an Asset. I.e., depending on the scenario’s situation, it is realized as laderr:canDamage (operational) or laderr:damaged (incident)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#incident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Represents a scenario that has already occurred."@en .
