<https://w3id.org/laderr#inhibits> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An Entity inhibits another if it has a Capability that disables a Vulnerability, while the inhibited Entity has a Capability that exploits the same Vulnerability."@en .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#baseURI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Defines the base URI of a LaDeRR Specification."@en .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#Scenario> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Represents a present or past situation (operational or incident, respectively) in which Entities and their Dispositions interact, allowing the evaluation of resilience conditions."@en .
