<https://w3id.org/laderr#Entity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An Entity is a core participant in a Scenario, encompassing Assets, Threats, and Controls. Entities typically possess Capabilities and may have Vulnerabilities. They can protect, threaten, or inhibit others, depending on how their internal Dispositions are enabled. These interactions are derived from the interplay between their capabilities and vulnerabilities."@en .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#protects> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Represents a relationship where an Entity prevents harm to another Entity by possessing a Capability that disables a Vulnerability that Threats might exploit."@en .
